*> Harness-only EXEC CICS ASKTIME + FORMATTIME MMDDYYYY DATESEP('-')
*> TIME TIMESEP: clock comes from faketime.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FMTTIME.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NOW PIC X(21).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-MMDDYYYY PIC X(10).
01 L-TIME PIC X(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-MMDDYYYY L-TIME.
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    STRING WS-NOW(5:2) '-' WS-NOW(7:2) '-' WS-NOW(1:4)
        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-MMDDYYYY END-STRING
    STRING WS-NOW(9:2) ':' WS-NOW(11:2) ':' WS-NOW(13:2)
        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TIME END-STRING
    GOBACK.
